# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project outputs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Search results: SQLite databases, candidate weights, training checkpoints, reports,
# and plots. These are reproducible from a configuration and a seed, and they get large
# quickly, so they are never committed. `artifacts/.gitkeep` preserves the directory.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/.gitkeep

# Datasets. CIFAR-10 alone is ~170 MB.
data/
datasets/

# Benchmark output
benchmark-results.json

# Log files
*.log
logs/
